        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YELT44-BWK, Transitional Ellington Entry Door Handleset with Brunswick Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ellington Handleset with Brunswick Lever features a perfect blend of modern and traditional styles to give nearly any front door a face-lift while still having a homey feel. This single cylinder handleset will fit most pre-drilled doors and comes packaged as a complete set to install easily with its adjustability. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Transitional Ellington Entry Door Handleset with Brunswick Lever is available in the hottest colors in the design world!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a lever operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Yale Expressions Ellington Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>Center to Center Door Prep: 5-1/2\"</l>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-3/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-5/8”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Clearance: 1-3/8</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Specs: 2-1/8” face bore, 1” edge bore, 1” x 2-1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Handing: handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YELT44-BWK-specifications.pdf?v=1704262432\"><b>Yale YELT44-BWK Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
