                "title": "Ellington Handleset with Brunswick Lever",
                "description": "The Ellington Handleset with Brunswick Lever features a perfect blend of modern and traditional styles to give nearly any front door a face-lift while still having a homey feel. This single cylinder handleset will fit most pre-drilled doors and comes packaged as a complete set to install easily with its adjustability. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Transitional Ellington Entry Door Handleset with Brunswick Lever is available in the hottest colors in the design world!",
